  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hearts in Search of God: Pilgrim Ways for the Catholic Dioceses of England &amp; Wales.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.	The name of the Project is Hearts in Search of God: Pilgrim Ways for the Catholic Dioceses of England &amp; Wales. 
1.2.	Its aim is to promote walking pilgrimage within England &amp; Wales by developing pilgrim ways between the cathedral of each Catholic diocese and one or more shrines within that diocese. The ways welcome people of all faiths and none.
1.3.	The duration of the Project is 3 years. This MOU is for the second year of the Project. 
1.4.	This MOU aims to promote effective working between the parties and ensure the efficient, transparent and accountable use of the grant monies from the Sisters of the Holy Cross CIC for the Project. 
1.5.	It will be operative for one calendar year from the receipt of the grant.</narrative>
  </description>
